  "goodToKnow": "Das Zahlungsmittel is a means of payment: Bargeld, Karte, Überweisung. Euro notes are the only unrestricted gesetzliches Zahlungsmittel (legal tender) in Germany. Germans have long preferred cash; though card payments now dominate in value, many small cafés and bakeries still say Nur Barzahlung. The EU is preparing a digital euro as an additional Zahlungsmittel. The plural is the same."
